                            Georgia Tech is special in that it's located in the heart of Atlanta. When you
                            leave
                            our
                            campus 'bubble', you step right into the vibrant, culturally diverse city. Check
                            out
                            this traveller's guide that GTIA has put together for you!
                        </p>
