            <h1 class="text-center">FOOD</h1>

            <section class="pt-2">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="pl-5">
                        <h3 class="color-dark-primary">What off-campus dining options do you recommend
                            around
                            campus, especially for those with dietary restrictions?</h3>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary pt-3">
                            Because Georgia Tech is optimally located in Atlanta, you have access to plenty
                            of
                            dining options within walking distance from campus. If you have certain dietary
                            preferences, fret not! Many restaurants in Atlanta cater to those who have
                            specific
                            dietary restrictions. Check out GTIA's curated list of favorite restaurants <a
                                href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/10rp8AFoQY05PGAEuulbCgKE7P98NLOPHm0hdYKrDCbg/edit?usp=sharing"
                                class="color-primary" target="_blank">here</a>! (We've noted if restaurants
                            are
                            vegan/vegetarian-friendly!)
                        </p>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary ">
                            If you're not in the mood to leave campus to grab some grub, you can use
                            services
                            such
                            as Uber Eats, Grubhub, and Doordash. There are also services that deliver
                            home-cooked
                            Indian and Chinese food to campus for pickup. Each of these services have their
                            own
                            group chats, in which you can join to place orders and then pick up on campus.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

